{"product_id":"diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-the-meltdown-book-13","title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid: The Meltdown (book 13)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen snow shuts down Greg Heffley's middle school, his neighborhood transforms into a wintry battlefield. Rival groups fight over territory, build massive snow forts, and stage epic snowball fights. And in the crosshairs are Greg and his trusty best friend, Rowley Jefferson.It's a fight for survival as Greg and Rowley navigate alliances, betrayals, and warring gangs in a neighborhood meltdown. When the snow clears, will Greg and Rowley emerge as heroes? Or will they even survive to see another day? \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jeff Kinney \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780141378206 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45089355399321,"sku":"10RC9780141378206","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/679274f46cb4b-Diary_20of_20a_20Wimpy_20Kid-_20The_20Meltdown_20_book_2013_20Jeff_20Kinney.jpg?v=1737814737","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-the-meltdown-book-13","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}